+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Filter: httpbin_status_200._path LIKE Utf8("/status/%")                                                             |
|               |   TableScan: httpbin_status_200 projection=[_path, content]                                                         |
| physical_plan | CoalesceBatchesExec: target_batch_size=8192                                                                         |
|               |   FilterExec: _path@0 LIKE /status/%                                                                                |
|               |     RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(16), input_partitions=1                                           |
|               |       CooperativeExec                                                                                               |
|               |         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                          |
|               |           HttpExec: base_url=https://httpbin.org/status/200, format=auto, partitions=[(path="", query="", body="")] |
|               |                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
